   - The summary must be a single, simple, clear sentence.
   - It should mention the film’s full title, the full name(s) of the director(s), and their confirmed place(s) of birth.
   - The sentence should be self-contained and understandable without referring back to the paragraphs.
   - Follow this example format:  
     "The director of the film 'Film Title,' Director Name, was born in Place."  
     For multiple directors:  
     "The directors of the film 'Film Title,' Director One and Director Two, were born in Place One and Place Two, respectively."

