- Films may be referenced with or without their year or added descriptor (e.g., "Hell (2011 film)"). Treat these as the same when matching.
- Director names and birthplace facts may appear in different paragraphs.
- Some paragraphs include extended biographical or filmographic details—extract only relevant birthplace information.
