- First, isolate the film paragraph(s) to identify director(s).
- Then, separately locate biographical paragraphs corresponding to those director(s).
- Extract explicit birthplace(s) with care to avoid mixing information.
- Finally, coherently combine extracted information into one clear sentence answering the question precisely.

This instruction ensures generation of fact-based, concise answers directly addressing the birthplace of the director(s) of a named film using only the supplied paragraphs.
